{"sectionId":"coordination/cft","items":[{"id":"coordination--cft-k001","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"팔면체 결정장에서 dxy,dxz,dyz의 t₂g는 −0.4Δo, dz²,dx²−y²의 e_g는 +0.6Δo 상대 에너지를 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k002","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"d⁴~d⁷ 팔면체 착물에서 Δo와 짝지음 에너지의 상대 크기에 따라 고스핀·저스핀 배치가 가능하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k003","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"d⁶ 고스핀은 t₂g⁴e_g²로 홀전자 4개, 저스핀은 t₂g⁶으로 홀전자 0개다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k004","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"결정장 안정화 에너지는 전자 배치와 각 오비탈 에너지의 합으로 계산하며 짝지음 에너지는 별도로 고려한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k005","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"정사면체에서는 e가 낮고 t₂가 높으며 Δt≈4/9Δo 근사는 유사한 금속·리간드 조건에서 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k006","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"정사면체 착물은 흔히 고스핀이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k007","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"평면사각형 d⁸ 착물에서는 dx²−y²가 크게 높아져 저스핀 반자성 배치가 흔하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k008","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"분광화학적 계열에서 CN⁻,CO는 강한 장, halide는 대체로 약한 장이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k009","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"d-d 전이는 착물 색의 원인 중 하나이며 전하이동 전이도 강한 색을 만들 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k010","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"spin-only 자기모멘트 μ≈√(n(n+2))","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k011","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"BM이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k012","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"팔면체 t₂g 3개, e_g 2개.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k013","sectionId":"coordination/cft","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"Δ가 클수록 짝지음이 유리해질 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--cft-k014","sectionId":"